    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1400">

                <pb facs="1317" n="1151" xml:id="pg1151"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/1072</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Jefferson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 447</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 30, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Supplementing my cablegram of November 14,
                    4 p.m. I have the honor to further report that the extraordinary session of the
                    Nicaraguan Congress on that date finally approved the contracts with the bankers
                    and also the financial plan without any amendments. Executive Decree No. 18,
                    with its translation, approving the contracts and the plan is herewith
                    attached.</p>
                <p>I have [etc]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Benjamin L. Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1400-a1.xml" xpointer="d1400-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
